{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 40, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a plan for Japan a journey grand\nA fortnight's span across that wondrous land.\n\n**Day First Tokyo's Gleam**\n\nArrive at Narita a bustling sight\nTransfer to Shinjuku bathed in neon light.\nA hotel chosen for comfort and ease\nThen wander streets a gentle summer breeze.\nDinner awaits a ramen's savory grace\nA vibrant start to this enchanted place.\n\n**Day Second Tokyo's Wonders**\n\nTo Asakusa then we swiftly go\nSensoji Temple where ancient spirits flow.\nNakamise-dori a market bright\nFor trinkets treats and visions pure and light.\nThe Imperial Palace a stately view\nThen Ginza's shops for treasures fresh and new.\n\n**Day Third Hakone's Beauty**\n\nFrom Tokyo's sprawl to Hakone we flee\nMountains and lakes a sight for all to see.\nCruise Lake Ashi a tranquil scene\nMount Fuji's peak a majestic queen.\nArt museums grace this scenic hold\nA peaceful respite stories to be told.\n\n**Day Fourth Kyoto's Charm**\n\nThe Shinkansen calls a speedy ride\nTo Kyoto's heart where history does reside.\nGion district stroll where geishas grace\nA fleeting glimpse a most enchanting space.\nA temple visit Kiyomizu-dera's height\nBreathtaking views bathed in golden light.\n\n**Day Fifth Kyoto's Gardens**\n\nArashiyama's bamboo forest deep\nWhere sunlight filters secrets it does keep.\nTenryu-ji Temple a garden serene\nA tranquil haven a peaceful scene.\nGolden Pavilion Kinkaku-ji's gleam\nReflecting beauty a waking dream.\n\n**Day Sixth Nara's Deer**\n\nTo Nara we journey a joyful quest\nWhere friendly deer put spirits to the test.\nTodai-ji Temple houses Buddha's might\nA colossal statue a wondrous sight.\nKasuga Taisha lanterns softly glow\nA sacred place where ancient stories flow.\n\n**Day Seventh Osaka's Delights**\n\nOsaka's vibrant energy we find\nDotonbori's lights a joyful kind.\nOsaka Castle a fortress bold\nA history rich in tales untold.\nStreet food beckons a culinary art\nTakoyaki okonomiyaki a joyful start.\n\n**Day Eighth Hiroshima's Peace**\n\nTo Hiroshima then we make our way\nA somber place where shadows hold their sway.\nPeace Memorial Park a poignant plea\nFor lasting peace for you and me.\nMuseum exhibits tell a tragic tale\nOf hope and healing beyond the veil.\n\n**Day Ninth Miyajima's Shrine**\n\nMiyajima Island a wondrous place\nIts floating torii a sight to embrace.\nItsukushima Shrine a sacred view\nA timeless beauty forever true.\nHiking trails wind through forests green\nA peaceful haven a tranquil scene.\n\n**Day Tenth Kanazawa's Grace**\n\nKanazawa's gardens a refined display\nKenrokuen's beauty lights the day.\nSamurai district a historic stroll\nPreserving memories of a bygone role.\nGold Leaf artistry a subtle art\nA treasure found to warm the heart.\n\n**Day Eleventh Return to Tokyo**\n\nBack to Tokyo a familiar shore\nFor last minute shopping and so much more.\nShibuya crossing a human tide\nA vibrant spectacle far and wide.\nFarewell dinners memories to hold\nOf Japan's wonders stories to be told.\n\n**Day Twelfth Departure**\n\nTo Narita Airport we swiftly go\nA fond farewell to lands below.\nWith treasures gathered and spirit bright\nWe bid adieu to Japan's gentle light.\nMay memories linger a joyful art\nForever etched within the heart.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5393308401107788}, {"token": "▁plan", "logprob": -1.661582589149475}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.0019733496010303497}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.05252811312675476}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.011049510911107063}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.2723214626312256}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.04620106518268585}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0007048744591884315}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.19235363602638245}, {"token": "▁fortnight", "logprob": -2.445216178894043}, {"token": "